### Create Rental Pricing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pricing-configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "2b6ea1ef-219d-452b-9e53-f4c98e3b9868",
  "tripType": "CHAUFFEUR_RENTAL",
  "baseFee": null,
  "perKmCharge": null,
  "driverAllowance": 300,
  "minimumBillableKm": null,
  "includedDurationMinutes": 480,
  "includedDistanceKm": 80,
  "packagePrice": 2500,
  "extraHourCharge": 250,
  "extraKmCharge": 18
}